  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "HPOIiGVI0l6X"
   },
   "source": [
    "We start by downloading a multi-modal dataset, we'll be using the `aurelio-ai/shrek-detection` dataset from Hugging Face."
   ]
  },
